    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/personal-bodyguard/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Personal Bodyguard Theme is an ideal template designed for personal security services, including private security firms, bodyguards, and safety escorts, offering a professional platform to showcase advanced security solutions and tactical protection services. Tailored for businesses providing executive protection, VIP escort services, and high-profile client safety, it highlights offerings such as personal security officer hire, close protection, and confidential security operations with clarity and authority. This theme is well-suited for agencies that also deal with specialized areas like protective armor solutions, trained personnel using professional police equipment standards, and tactical security planning for events and individuals. Its clean and authoritative design ensures services such as personal protection officer deployment, risk assessment, and specialist security guard hire are presented effectively. With bold visuals, structured layouts, and integration with booking and inquiry forms, clients can easily request services or consultations. Fully responsive and optimized for performance, the theme ensures seamless browsing across devices while building trust and credibility for any security-focused business."
    },
